{"schema_version":"benchmark-q1-semantic-issue-coverage-judgment-luna5","question_id":"Q1-semantic-issue-coverage","status":"ok","judge_run_name":"luna8-v4-medium-196-glm-5.3-max-full200-2026-10-01","prediction_set_name":"glm-5.3-max-full200-2026-10-01","paper_id":"2501.15976","judge_input_sha256":"8f1495781d944a22433cee46a4eca0d9fb9b5863e242f496ee14e0ad431c21be","gold_decisions":[{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I002","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-005","focus_relation":"different_causal_subject","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I002:U002","2501.15976:I002:U005","2501.15976:I002:U007"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-005:U001","ISSUE-005:U002","ISSUE-005:U004"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue concerns failure of injectivity of the interpolation map, redundant generators, and the resulting dimension and matrix-basis claims. ISSUE-005 concerns missing quasi-uniform mesh hypotheses; it does not diagnose rank loss or redundancy of interpolated coarse generators.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I005","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I005:U001","2501.15976:I005:U002","2501.15976:I005:U003"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U002","ISSUE-003:U004"],"same_causal_subject":true,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is the failure of exact reconstruction caused by the correction term in the definition of v_{h,ell}. ISSUE-003 identifies a separate missing L2 contribution in a norm estimate and repairs that estimate; it does not recognize that the decomposition itself is not exact.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I006","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-003","focus_relation":"different_obligation_or_hypothesis","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I006:U001","2501.15976:I006:U003","2501.15976:I006:U006"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-003:U001","ISSUE-003:U002","ISSUE-003:U004"],"same_causal_subject":true,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is an invocation of an interpolation theorem at m=1 although the theorem assumes m≥2. ISSUE-003 instead diagnoses an incorrect coefficient in a stable-splitting norm estimate and does not identify the invalid m=1 hypothesis use or repair it.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2501.15976:I008","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_operation_step_or_formula","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2501.15976:I008:U001","2501.15976:I008:U003","2501.15976:I008:U008"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U001","ISSUE-002:U002","ISSUE-002:U005"],"same_causal_subject":true,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is that GMRES iterates are placed in a linear Krylov space instead of the affine space x^0+K^m(C,r^0). ISSUE-002 concerns the Lambda dependence of an iteration-count estimate and does not diagnose the invalid search-space formula.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]}],"audit":{"all_gold_ids_decided":true,"all_ranked_candidates_considered":true,"target_type_not_used_for_identity":true,"severity_not_used_for_identity":true,"prediction_reuse_requires_explicit_issue_support":true,"each_gold_credited_at_most_once":true,"combined_entries_are_self_contained_diagnoses":true,"support_limit_three_respected":true}}